.TH "TEST" 1 "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP User Commands"
.SH NAME
test \- execute native Parikshak automated test suites or list registered tests
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php test
[\fB\-\-list\fR|\fB\-\-discover\fR]
[\fB\-\-coverage\fR]
[\fB\-\-teamcity\fR]
[\fB\-\-parallel\fR[\fB=\fIN\fR]]
[\fB\-\-watch\fR|\fB\-w\fR]
[\fB\-\-update-snapshots\fR|\fB\-u\fR]
[\fB\-\-bail\fR|\fB\-x\fR]
[\fB\-\-failed\fR|\fB\-\-retry\fR]
[\fB\-\-profile\fR]
[\fB\-\-compact\fR|\fB\-c\fR]
[\fB\-\-filter=\fINAME\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBtest\fR command executes Parikshak automated unit and feature tests under an isolated in-memory SQLite database environment for the active application context. When invoked with \fB\-\-list\fR or \fB\-\-discover\fR, it performs static AST introspection to discover and display all test suites and test methods across the project.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR, \fB\-\-discover\fR
Discovers and lists all registered test suites, test file paths, and test method names without executing code.
.TP
\fB\-\-coverage\fR
Enables code coverage metrics reporting using Xdebug or PCOV.
.TP
\fB\-\-teamcity\fR
Emits real-time TeamCity service messages for PhpStorm, VS Code Test Explorer, and CI pipeline test trees.
.TP
\fB\-\-parallel\fR[\fB=\fIN\fR]
Executes test suites concurrently across N worker processes (default: 4).
.TP
\fB\-\-watch\fR, \fB\-w\fR
Enables continuous observation mode, re-running tests upon file modification.
.TP
\fB\-\-update-snapshots\fR, \fB\-u\fR
Updates recorded snapshots to match current execution output.
.TP
\fB\-\-bail\fR, \fB\-x\fR
Aborts test suite execution immediately upon encountering the first failure.
.TP
\fB\-\-failed\fR, \fB\-\-retry\fR
Re-runs only the test suites or files that failed during the most recent test run.
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR
Measures test execution times and reports the top slowest test cases.
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR, \fB\-c\fR
Renders concise dot-progress output, printing detailed errors and diffs only on failure.
.TP
\fB\-\-filter=\fINAME\fR
Restricts execution to matching test suites, files, or method names.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
.IP \(bu 2
Introspects test suites using \fB\\SPPMod\\Parikshak\\SPPTestRunner::discover()\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
Enforces isolated database testing using in-memory SQLite (\fBsqlite::memory:\fR).
.IP \(bu 2
Executes tests extending \fB\\SPPMod\\Parikshak\\SPPTestCase\fR or written in fluent DSL (\fBtest()\fR, \fBexpect()\fR).
.IP \(bu 2
Emits TeamCity event protocols when \fB\-\-teamcity\fR is specified.
.IP \(bu 2
Restores original database configuration upon test completion.
